  "prefLabel": "Lot 8001.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8001.02 Scope. The rules in this chapter shall apply to all individuals, organizations, associations, or corporations whose involvement in racing activities conducted in the State of New Hampshire require licensure in accordance with RSA 284.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
